    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack </strong>toys. <strong>Ship </strong>orders. <strong>Finish </strong>the shift. And repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/a94411881faf899429c62f406d71f7dd.poster.avif?t=1755717196\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/a94411881faf899429c62f406d71f7dd.webm?t=1755717196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/a94411881faf899429c62f406d71f7dd.mp4?t=1755717196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds simple \u2014 until the warehouse stops feeling empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You took a night job at a quiet warehouse, hoping for easy money. What seemed like a simple packing job slowly reveals something much darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.poster.avif?t=1755717196\" width=700 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.webm?t=1755717196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839320/extras/fefecb255c2ffaf756efb9f883f9dc80.mp4?t=1755717196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack and ship toys and candy</strong> under growing pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
